OL,3,GNEWSAPeople face fines for smoking or
OL,4,Avaping near schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople could find themselves being
OL,7,Ffined if they smoke or vape near
OL,8,Fschools.
OL,10,FThe new rules brought in by Knowsley
OL,11,FCouncil will also apply to other public
OL,12,Fspaces, such as playgrounds and outside
OL,13,Flibraries.
OL,15,FA council spokesman said the smoke-free
OL,16,Fand vape-free zones would be brought in
OL,17,Fwith a view to giving people fixed
OL,18,Fpenalty notices in the future.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
