OL,3,GNEWSAPeople face fines for smoking or
OL,4,Avaping near schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FA ban is already in place at The
OL,7,FPrescot School. Principal Michael
OL,8,FReynolds said "the setting up of these
OL,9,Fzones to not be able to smoke or to
OL,10,Fvape outside the school can only be
OL,11,Fseen as a positive".
